    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not even a rut though. a rut implies you're at least moving, even if it's slow. i just feel... static. like i'm a ghost haunting my own life. i look at people laughing or enjoying things and i feel like i'm watching a movie in a language i don't speak. i'm just so tired of the nothingness. i just want it to stop. i just want to feel something, or even just to not feel this hollow nothing.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
